# device-layer-0011.
# Motion: the acceleration the device feels, gravity included, through CoreMotion on iOS, SensorManager on
# Android and DeviceMotionEvent in a browser. A Mac, a desktop JVM and the iOS simulator have no accelerometer.
#
#   read-motion   `<x> <y> <z>` in metres per second squared, to two places, or unavailable
#
# A host with no such capability (the server, the memory host) answers `unavailable`. Every answer is text from the
# closed set above, so an app compares strings and no platform enum ever reaches it.

load ./native/{platform}/motion
  find sample-motion

task read-motion
  like text
  send back
    call sample-motion
